                //         1.851/2.627 (12.180 / 13.031 / 13.807)
                //   robot base  5.590  cap **2.236** ... 0.5->1.000 and 1->1.851
                //         pass, but **2->2.236 hits the cap** (GD 7.826; the
                //         uncapped model gave 8.217)
                //   mini robot base 4.472  cap **1.789** ... |m|=1 and 2 are both
