                        // a held ship dies 0.23-0.87 px short of the line (perpendicular 15.21 /
                        // 15.32 full, 9.53 / 9.60 mini), while at the same tick a released attempt
                        // lives nearer than that (15.244; 9.564 between two held deaths at
